; Installer's strings, in English: the program is built with these, and a
; translation in LOCALE:Catalogs/<language>/Installer.catalog stands in
; for them. A text with values is written by RawDoFmt, which takes them
; in order: a translation keeps them so. A text a page shows goes through
; text.gadget, which reads < as the start of a mark: a translation writes
; << for one.
#version 1
;
; The window.
MSG_WINDOW_TITLE (1//)
Install the system
MSG_BACK (//)
_Back
MSG_NEXT (//)
_Next
;
; The first page: the language.
MSG_LANGUAGE_TITLE (//)
Language
MSG_LANGUAGE_INTRO (//)
Choose the language the system speaks. It is used as you go on, and the installed system starts in it.
MSG_COLUMN_LANGUAGE (//)
Language and country
;
; The second page: the keyboard.
MSG_KEYBOARD_TITLE (//)
Keyboard
MSG_KEYBOARD_INTRO (//)
Choose the keyboard's layout. It is used at once: try it in the field below.
MSG_COLUMN_KEYMAP (//)
Keymap
MSG_COLUMN_LAYOUT (//)
Layout
MSG_TRY (//)
_Try it
;
; The third page: the disk.
MSG_TARGET_TITLE (//)
Disk
MSG_TARGET_INTRO (//)
Choose the disk the system goes onto. Everything on it is lost.
MSG_COLUMN_DEVICE (//)
Device
MSG_COLUMN_UNIT (//)
Unit
MSG_COLUMN_SIZE (//)
Size
MSG_COLUMN_HOLDS (//)
What it holds
MSG_HOLDS_CONTAINER (//)
GPT with a PowerOS container
MSG_HOLDS_GPT (//)
GPT
MSG_HOLDS_TABLE (//)
PowerOS table
MSG_HOLDS_FOREIGN (//)
a table for another block size
MSG_HOLDS_NOTHING (//)
nothing
MSG_HOLDS_UNREADABLE (//)
cannot be read
MSG_HOLDS_RUNNING (//)
%s - the running system
MSG_LOOK_AGAIN (//)
_Look again
MSG_TARGET_NONE (//)
There is no disk to install onto. Put in a card, an SSD or a stick, then press Look again.
MSG_TARGET_CHOOSE (//)
Choose a disk.
MSG_TARGET_RUNNING (//)
The running system is on this disk: it cannot be installed over.
MSG_TARGET_SMALL (//)
This disk holds %s, and the system needs %s at least.
MSG_TARGET_UNREADABLE (//)
This disk cannot be read.
MSG_TARGET_FITS (//)
%s on %s unit %d.
;
; The fourth page: the last look.
MSG_CONFIRM_TITLE (//)
Ready
MSG_CONFIRM_DISK (//)
Disk: %s unit %d, %s
MSG_CONFIRM_LANGUAGE (//)
Language: %s
MSG_CONFIRM_KEYMAP (//)
Keyboard: %s
MSG_CONFIRM_LOST (//)
Everything on this disk is lost.
MSG_INSTALL (//)
_Install
;
; The fifth page: the install going.
MSG_PROGRESS_TITLE (//)
Installing
MSG_PHASE_LOOKING (//)
Looking at the system ...
MSG_PHASE_PREPARING (//)
Making the partitions ...
MSG_PHASE_COPYING (//)
Copying the system ...
MSG_PHASE_SETTINGS (//)
Writing the settings ...
MSG_COPIED (//)
%d files copied (%s)
MSG_STOP (//)
_Stop
MSG_STOPPING (//)
Stopping ...
MSG_NO_PROCESS (//)
There is no process to run the install on.
;
; The last page: what it came to.
MSG_DONE_TITLE (//)
Done
MSG_DONE (//)
The system is installed: %d files (%s).
MSG_DONE_NEXT (//)
Take the stick out and restart the machine: it starts from the disk.
MSG_FAILED (//)
The install could not finish.
MSG_STOPPED (//)
The install was stopped.
MSG_NOT_BOOTABLE (//)
The disk holds no system that starts. Back leads to the disks again.
MSG_RESTART (//)
_Restart
MSG_RESTART_FAILED (//)
C:Reboot could not restart the machine.
;
; Said on the console when the window cannot open.
MSG_NOLIBRARY (//)
%s: can't open %s\n
MSG_NOMEMORY (//)
%s: no memory\n
MSG_NOWINDOW (//)
%s: no window\n
